<title>INDIA: INDIA-Primary dealer quotes on securities-April 21.</title>
<headline>INDIA-Primary dealer quotes on securities-April 21.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primary dealers made the</p>
<p>following two-way quotes on Monday for dated government</p>
<p>securities and treasury bills</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Government securities</p>
<p>---------------------</p>
<p>		    DFHI		STCI	     I-Sec</p>
<p>					 (Bid/offer)	   (in rupees)</p>
<p>13.50% 97    ------/------   102.35/102.55   ------/------</p>
<p>13.80% 02    ------/------   106.70/107.10   ------/------</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>		    SBI Gilts	 GSTC	    PNB Gilts</p>
<p>					 (Bid/offer)	   (in rupees)</p>
<p>13.85% 01    105.00/106.00   ------/------   ------/------</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Treasury bills</p>
<p>---------------------</p>
<p>Maturing	  DFHI	   STCI	     I-Sec</p>
<p>on				    (Bid/offer)	(in percent)</p>
<p>10/05/97     ------/------     4.75/3.75     ------/------</p>
<p>18/07/97     ------/------     6.25/5.75     ------/------</p>
<p>10/04/98     ------/------     9.00/8.70     ------/------</p>
<p>--/--/--     ------/------   ------/------   ------/------</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Maturing	  SBI Gilts    GSTC	     PNB Gilts</p>
<p>on				     (Bid/offer)	(in percent)</p>
<p>28/03/98	 9.00/8.50     ------/------   ------/------</p>
<p>10/04/98	 9.25/8.80     ------/------   ------/------</p>
<p>--/--/--     ------/------   ------/------   ------/------</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Note : DFHI - Discount and Finance House of India Ltd.</p>
<p>	 STCI - Securities Trading Corporation of India Ltd.</p>
<p>	 I-Sec- ICICI Securities and Finance Company Ltd.</p>
<p>	 GSTC - Gilts Securities Trading Corporation Ltd.</p>
<p>	   + Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
